========================================================
CALENDAR UI POLISH
Every property here is one your tenant already accepts.
No Radius on Rectangle - not supported in your library.
Apply in order. Section 1 first, it fixes real bugs.
========================================================


========================================================
SECTION 1 - FIXES  (do these first)
========================================================

1.1  galCalendar -> TemplateSize
     Self.Height / 6

     Kills the stray 43rd cell below row 6 and evens out
     the row heights.

1.2  galWeekdays -> Width
     galCalendar.Width

     Header row currently stops short of SAT.

1.3  galWeekdays -> X
     galCalendar.X

