========================================================
SECTION 2 - CALENDAR GRID
========================================================

2.1  recCellBg -> Fill
If(
    !ThisItem.InMonth,
    RGBA(252, 253, 254, 1),
    ThisItem.CellDate = Coalesce(varCalSelected, Today()),
    RGBA(232, 242, 254, 1),
    ThisItem.EvtCount > 0,
    RGBA(243, 248, 255, 1),
    ThisItem.IsToday,
    RGBA(250, 252, 255, 1),
    RGBA(255, 255, 255, 1)
)

     Softer wash than before. The accent bar carries the
     colour instead of the whole cell shouting.
     Weekend tint dropped - it fought with the event tint.

2.2  recCellBg -> BorderColor
     RGBA(237, 240, 244, 1)

2.3  lblDayNum -> Size
     11

2.4  lblDayNum -> Color
If(
    ThisItem.CellDate = Coalesce(varCalSelected, Today()),
    RGBA(255, 255, 255, 1),
    !ThisItem.InMonth,
    RGBA(199, 205, 214, 1),
    ThisItem.IsToday,
    RGBA(21, 101, 192, 1),
    ThisItem.IsWeekend,
    RGBA(148, 163, 184, 1),
    RGBA(30, 41, 59, 1)
)

     Weekends now read as secondary via the number, not
     the cell background.

2.5  lblDayNum -> FontWeight
If(
    ThisItem.IsToday || ThisItem.CellDate = Coalesce(varCalSelected, Today()),
    FontWeight.Bold,
    FontWeight.Semibold
)


